    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Evaluate this lead application for the AI Workflow Implementation Package.\n\nUse the submitted lead data below to decide whether the lead is:\n- qualified\n- not_qualified\n- human_review\n\nQualification guidance:\n- The business should be actively operating or clearly preparing to launch.\n- The lead should describe a real business process or operational problem that could plausibly benefit from automation.\n- Stronger fit generally means the problem happens repeatedly and has a meaningful business impact.\n- The current offer starts at $3,000, so budget should be considered seriously.\n- The lead should have meaningful involvement in approving the investment.\n- A timeline within 90 days is generally a stronger fit.\n- Use human_review when the application is ambiguous, contradictory, incomplete, or presents an edge case that should not be automatically accepted or rejected.\n- Do not invent facts that are not present in the application.\n\nReturn only the structured output required by the connected output parser.\n\nLead data:\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nBusiness name: {{ $json.business_name }}\nBusiness type: {{ $json.business_type }}\nOperating status: {{ $json.operating_status }}\nProblem: {{ $json.problem }}\nFrequency: {{ $json.frequency }}\nBusiness impact: {{ $json.business_impact }}\nDesired outcome: {{ $json.desired_outcome }}\nBudget: {{ $json.budget }}\nDecision authority: {{ $json.decision_authority }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.timeline }}\nAdditional notes: {{ $json.additional_notes }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        448,
        160
